    "intro": "<h1><a id=\"_jnjsn8h1l53v\"></a><strong>16-Day Rajasthan and Northern India Cultural Tour :</strong></h1>Embark on an exhilarating 16-day adventure through the heart of Rajasthan and Northern India, crafted for European travelers like you who crave vibrant history, royal splendor, and cultural immersion! Starting and ending in Delhi, this journey takes you to Pataudi’s cinematic palace, Mandawa’s frescoed havelis, Bikaner’s desert forts, Jaisalmer’s golden dunes, Udaipur’s romantic lakes, Jaipur’s pink palaces, and Agra’s iconic Taj Mahal, with unique stops like Fort Chanwa, Deogarh, and Bundi. With cozy hotels, a magical desert camp, private transfers, and a well-paced itinerary, you’ll dive into India’s rich heritage with experiences tailored to your love for architecture, local crafts, and authentic traditions. Let’s explore your dream trip!<h2><a id=\"_q0rl7mrzl4jw\"></a><strong>Key Points</strong></h2><ul><li><strong>Duration</strong>: 15 days, 14 nights, covering Delhi, Pataudi, Alsisar, Mandawa, Fatehpur, Nawalgarh, Mukundgarh, Bikaner, Gajner, Jaisalmer, Fort Chanwa, Deogarh, Udaipur, Chittorgarh, Bundi, Kota, Jaipur, and Agra.</li><li><strong>Travel</strong>: Private car transfers between destinations.</li><li><strong>Highlights</strong>: Taj Mahal, Jaisalmer desert camp, Udaipur’s lakes, and Amber Fort.</li><li><strong>Pace</strong>: Balanced with sightseeing, cultural activities, and relaxation, ideal for European travelers.</li><li><strong>Cultural Appeal</strong>: Focus on Rajasthani traditions, Mughal architecture, and offbeat heritage, resonating with European interests.</li></ul><h2><a id=\"_skzyeeoiv86t\"></a><strong>Overview</strong></h2>This 15-day itinerary is your gateway to Northern India’s most iconic and hidden gems. From Delhi’s Mughal landmarks to Rajasthan’s desert forts, romantic palaces, and vibrant towns, and Agra’s world-famous Taj Mahal, each stop is a vibrant chapter in India’s story. With daily breakfast and comfortable accommodations (including a desert camp and heritage hotels), and curated activities like camel safaris and heritage walks, this tour is designed for European travelers seeking history, culture, and unique experiences.<table><thead><tr><th>Day</th><th>Route</th><th>Hotels</th></tr><tr><th>Day 01</th><th>Arrive Delhi</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 02</th><th>Delhi</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 03</th><th>Delhi - Pataudi - Alsisar - Mandawa</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 04</th><th>Mandawa</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 05</th><th>Mandawa - Bikaner</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 06</th><th>Bikaner - Jaisalmer</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 07</th><th>Jaisalmer</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 08</th><th>Jaisalmer - Jodhpur - Luni</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 09</th><th>Fort Chanwa - Deogarh</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 10</th><th>Deogarh - Ranakpur - Udaipur</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 11</th><th>Udaipur</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 12</th><th>Udaipur - Chittorgarh - Bundi</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 13</th><th>Bundi - Jaipur</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 14</th><th>Jaipur</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 15</th><th>Jaipur - Abhaneri - Sikri - Agra</th><th></th></tr><tr><th>Day 16</th><th>Agra - Delhi</th><th></th></tr></thead></table><h1><a id=\"_y6k7iynloukv\"></a></h1><h1><a id=\"_k34fti9gdw8f\"></a><strong>Detailed Itinerary</strong></h1><h2><a id=\"_2f28bvld1gum\"></a><strong>Day 1: Arrive in Delhi</strong></h2>Welcome to India! You’ll land at<a href=\"https://www.newdelhiairport.in/\"> Indira Gandhi International Airport</a> in Delhi, where our friendly representative will greet you and transfer you to your hotel. After a long flight, take this evening to relax and recharge.",
