      "<strong>Dinner and overnight stay in Delhi.</strong><h2><a id=\"_pwf6ucl3sneo\"></a><strong>Day 2: Delhi Sightseeing</strong></h2>Morning Breakfast at your hotel,",
      "Afterwards you will dive into Delhi’s rich history! This morning, we’ll explore <strong>Old Delhi</strong>, starting with the <strong>Red Fort</strong>, a UNESCO World Heritage Site built by Emperor Shah Jahan. Its red sandstone walls and opulent palaces are a testament to Mughal grandeur.",
