      "Start at <strong>Hawa Mahal</strong>, the iconic “<strong>Palace of Winds</strong>” with its pink sandstone facade.A UNESCO site, Constructed in 1799, Hawa Mahal’s pink sandstone facade with 953 windows allowed royal women to observe street life.",
