          "In the next leg of the trip visit <strong>Thazhathangadi Valiapalli</strong> is a beautiful <strong>ancient church</strong> in Kumarakom, known for its stunning architecture and rich history. Built by <strong>Syrian Christians</strong> centuries ago, it holds deep cultural and religious significance. As you step inside, you’ll see intricate wooden carvings and peaceful surroundings that take you back in time.",
