          "Upon arrival check into your hotel.",
          "Thereafter visit <strong>Fort Kochi</strong> area which is a historic neighborhood in <strong>Kochi </strong>known for its colonial charm and relaxed vibe. Wandering through its narrow streets, you’ll discover colorful street art, quaint cafes, and a mix of old and new architecture.",
          "Afterwards explore <strong>Chinese Fishing Nets</strong>, Introduced in the 14th century, these cantilevered nets in Fort Kochi are a scenic highlight.",
