      "After breakfast, explore <strong>Agra Fort</strong>, A 16th-century UNESCO World Heritage Site. Agra Fort is a red sandstone stronghold with palaces like <strong>Jahangir Mahal and Khas Mahal</strong>. Constructed primarily from red sandstone, this imposing citadel narrates the splendors of Mughal might and architectural ingenuity.",
