          "Later embark on a scenic drive to Munnar (130 km, 4 hours), Kerala’s “Kashmir of South India,” nestled in the rolling heights of the Western Ghats. This tranquil haven boasts a cool climate, lush botanical scenery, verdant tea gardens, shimmering waterfalls, and misty mountain peaks that evoke poetic awe and deep relaxation.",
          "Upon arrival, check into your hotel amid rolling tea estates and misty hills—a paradise for nature lovers. Rest well, excited for tomorrow’s explorations."
